# 1.1-create.tape - 创建工程
# 在这一章，我们告诉观看者如何创建三层工程

Sleep 3s

# 比赛
Type `# 让我们创建一个比赛` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type `tuack-ng gen contest myoi` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type `ls` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1.5s
Type `# 出现了一个文件夹 myoi` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1.5s
Type `cd myoi` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type `ls` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 2s

Ctrl+l

Sleep 2s

# 比赛日
Type `# 让我们创建一个比赛日 day1` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1s
Type `tuack-ng gen day day1` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type `ls` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1.5s
Type `# 出现了一个文件夹 day1` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1.5s
Type `cd day1` Sleep 0.5 Enter
Type `ls` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 2s

Ctrl+l

Sleep 2s

# 题目
Type `# 让我们创建一个比赛题 aplusb` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1s
Type `tuack-ng gen problem aplusb` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type `ls` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1.5s
Type `# 出现了一个文件夹 aplusb` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1.5s
Type `cd aplusb` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type `ls` Sleep 0.5 Enter
Sleep 2s

Ctrl+l

Sleep 2s

Type `cd ../../..` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type `tree myoi` Sleep 0.5 Enter Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 3s

Type `# 这就是 Tuack-NG 的三层工程结构`
Sleep 3s

Hide
Ctrl+c
Ctrl+l
Show
